h\" >My Card Is Better Than Your Card! is an adorable yet challenging sticker sticking roguelike deckbuilder. Create your own cards with a colorful catalogue of stickers combining their effects. Collect more and more stickers, discover synergies and find your own playstyle with a deck full of your own creations to defeat your rivals in whimsical card duels.\u202f </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based gameplay, delightful events and free-form card crafting bring about a wholesome experience while presenting a challenge.\u202f</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 super awesome and adorable stickers to stick onto your cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against ten unique opponents, from best friends to playground princesses and bug enthusiasts! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 10 starter decks on what kind of cards and playstyle you want to start your run with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 challenging bosses to truly test your deckbuilding skills at the end of every week</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 toys to collect and synergize with your cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15 different types of fun events to visit, like digging for forgotten sticker treasures and trying your luck at a claw machine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super special Story Events to spend time with your friends from the neighborhood! Challenge them to water fights or go on an adventure in the forest! Who knows what\u2019ll happen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 themed booster packs to rip open and enjoy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three special sticker types that change how the stickers play and make them even cooler (or lamer)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras/1c7bb64cde5c4e358f7ba981696ccf64.avif?t=1762532373\" width=800 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras/7c9b461c1f478d380e462a46e9d66d0f.poster.avif?t=1762532373\" width=650 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras/7c9b461c1f478d380e462a46e9d66d0f.webm?t=1762532373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sticker has its own effect, allowing for endless creativity and strategies for you to play with! But be careful, too many stickers and a card will become too expensive to play.\u202f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras/4e5449cc263c655de09fefd5ba245c1f.avif?t=1762532373\" width=800 height=109 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras/545e1f97d99b2f63f22c7545b4b99351.poster.avif?t=1762532373\" width=650 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras/545e1f97d99b2f63f22c7545b4b99351.webm?t=1762532373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time for a tug-of-war of coolness! Play your cards right to gain favor over your rivals and leave them in awe of your creations! Make use of the FEVER multiplier to turn the tide at the right moment!\u202f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras/5bfe49e585f3785680d9ed190be28530.avif?t=1762532373\" width=800 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras/f72389e68f2a18c4c59e9cca89113af2.poster.avif?t=1762532373\" width=650 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras/f72389e68f2a18c4c59e9cca89113af2.webm?t=1762532373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between card battles you can take part in all sorts of activities to spice up your deck. Dig for hidden prizes in Treasure Hunts! Try your luck at the Vending Machine for that perfect super shiny sticker! Get to know your friends around the neighborhood in Story Events! Grab some new toys at the Claw Machine! Fill up your summer days with different fun events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras/eb7ad29b746bab7fe0163def78a46907.avif?t=1762532373\" width=800 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras/f9b9a55e9eb439daceaed85d02462bbd.avif?t=1762532373\" width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run alters the challenge. You\u2019ll encounter different neighborhood rivals, with a different set of cards to take them on. Figure out new synergies and combos to gain the edge over your opponents to become the playground champ!\u202f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras/5ec3807b0cb7a74da531c6b06d24c8c7.avif?t=1762532373\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/extras_big/5ec3807b0cb7a74da531c6b06d24c8c7.avif?t=1762532373 width=800 height=94 /></span><strong> </strong> </p>","developers":["Utu Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617620/ebdd085fa9113584e66946b762c2da106fc49fa5/header.jpg?t=1762532373","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3617620/826567384/34d1aed548539e38ecd4e267d588bb98e1271d16/1758555111/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758557121","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3617620/826567384/34d1aed548539e38ecd4e267d588bb98e1271d16/1758555111/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758557121","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3617620/826567384/34d1aed548539e38ecd4e267d588bb98e1271d16/1758555111/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758557121","id":257204076,"name":"My Card Is Better Than Your Card! - Early Access Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204076/40070bf6b5cdee682a9c30c21eba9dab831146f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758557121"}],"name":"My Card Is Better Than Your Card!","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"My Card Is Better Than Your Card! - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$